// fh1 - the program's icon. The first icon of a program is the one Windows shows for the file, its shortcuts,
// the taskbar and the window. CMake fills in the file: res/fh1.ico (original artwork, drawn by
// tools/fh1_make_icon.py), or res/fh1_local.ico when this PC has one (made from the builder's own picture with
// tools/fh1_make_icon.py --image; ignored by git).
IDI_ICON1 ICON "@FH1_ICON@"
